Package: ethnoshiny
Type: Package
Title: Quantitative Ethnobotany in a Shiny App
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: person("Whisnu Febry", "Afrianto", email = "whisnu.afrianto@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An interactive Shiny application for quantitative ethnobotany.
    Computes use value, relative frequency of citation, cultural importance,
    fidelity level and informant consensus factor, compares groups, runs
    correlation, NMDS and PERMANOVA analyses, draws networks, maps and
    several unconventional charts in the viridis palette, writes scientific
    names in italics, and exports Excel and HTML/Word reports. Start it with
    one command, ethnoshiny().
